Written by Bono and The Edge for the late, great Roy Orbison. Orbison
released the song on his "Mystery Girl" CD release in 1989, on which Bono
was a producer.  Rarely played by U2, but usually acoustically. Never
released in studio, it was first played by U2 on their Lovetown tour in
1989.
Bono tends to change the words around, but here is the master layout, as
written for Roy Orbison.

It's a very simple song with alternating |C F| |C G| progression with
